<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" version="1.1" creator="Spliced from BRouter tracks (46 West/Santa Rita + Los Osos Valley Road)" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1 http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1/gpx.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <name>Day 5: Paso Robles to Oceano</name>
    <desc>Day 5. Paso Robles - Highway 46 West - Santa Rita Road - Old Creek Road - Morro Bay - Los Osos - Los Osos Valley Road - Avila - Pismo - Oceano. Paved throughout. The back-road first half of the quieter inland line, rejoining the Los Osos Valley Road run to the coast at Morro Bay rather than climbing inland to San Luis Obispo.</desc>
  </metadata>
